<?xml version='1.1' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<project>
  <description>【演示 4】git-parameter 插件：参数化选择"分支/标签"构建

本任务演示：
1) Git Parameter 参数 BRANCH（类型: 分支）——构建时从下拉列表选择任意远端分支/标签
2) 分支说明符使用构建参数：Branch Specifier = ${BRANCH}，git 插件在构建时把参数替换成实际引用
3) 点击"立即构建"使用默认值 origin/main；"Build with Parameters"可选择其他分支（如 origin/test/test1）

说明：git-parameter 是 git 插件的常用扩展（本机已安装 git-parameter 462.463.v496a_59f698e5）。</description>
  <keepDependencies>false</keepDependencies>
  <properties>
    <hudson.model.ParametersDefinitionProperty>
      <parameterDefinitions>
        <net.uaznia.lukanus.hudson.plugins.gitparameter.GitParameterDefinition plugin="git-parameter@462.463.v496a_59f698e5">
          <name>BRANCH</name>
          <description>选择要构建的分支或标签</description>
          <uuid>6b1e64de-0004-4000-8000-000000000004</uuid>
          <type>PT_BRANCH</type>
          <branch>*</branch>
          <tagFilter>*</tagFilter>
          <branchFilter>.*</branchFilter>
          <sortMode>DESCENDING_SMART</sortMode>
          <defaultValue>origin/main</defaultValue>
          <selectedValue>NONE</selectedValue>
          <useRepository>https://github.com/yinshi197/JenkinsFile_repo.git</useRepository>
          <quickFilterEnabled>false</quickFilterEnabled>
          <listSize>5</listSize>
          <requiredParameter>false</requiredParameter>
        </net.uaznia.lukanus.hudson.plugins.gitparameter.GitParameterDefinition>
      </parameterDefinitions>
    </hudson.model.ParametersDefinitionProperty>
  </properties>
  <scm class="hudson.plugins.git.GitSCM" plugin="git@5.10.1">
    <configVersion>2</configVersion>
    <userRemoteConfigs>
      <hudson.plugins.git.UserRemoteConfig>
        <url>https://github.com/yinshi197/JenkinsFile_repo.git</url>
      </hudson.plugins.git.UserRemoteConfig>
    </userRemoteConfigs>
    <branches>
      <hudson.plugins.git.BranchSpec>
        <name>${BRANCH}</name>
      </hudson.plugins.git.BranchSpec>
    </branches>
    <doGenerateSubmoduleConfigurations>false</doGenerateSubmoduleConfigurations>
    <submoduleCfg class="empty-list"/>
    <extensions/>
  </scm>
  <canRoam>true</canRoam>
  <disabled>false</disabled>
  <blockBuildWhenDownstreamBuilding>false</blockBuildWhenDownstreamBuilding>
  <blockBuildWhenUpstreamBuilding>false</blockBuildWhenUpstreamBuilding>
  <triggers/>
  <concurrentBuild>false</concurrentBuild>
  <builders>
    <hudson.tasks.Shell>
      <command>echo "===== git-parameter 参数化构建 ====="
echo "BRANCH 参数      = $BRANCH"
echo "GIT_BRANCH(实际) = $GIT_BRANCH"
echo "GIT_COMMIT       = $GIT_COMMIT"
echo
echo "===== 当前所在分支与提交 ====="
git branch --show-current
git log -1 --oneline
echo
echo "===== 远端全部分支（git-parameter 下拉值来源）====="
git branch -r</command>
    </hudson.tasks.Shell>
  </builders>
  <publishers/>
  <buildWrappers/>
</project>
